Cyrus is sitting by his working table, looking at maps of some territories. When he noticed you coming through the door, he put them aside.
"Mr. Cyrus, do you happen to have the map of the Wild Island?" you ask.
"I had it somewhere," he answered, "let's look for it".
You kept searching for quite a long time, in spite of the fact, that everyone helped. Alas, a sheet of parchment that was found, disappointed you. The map was incomplete, and was not of much benefit to you.
"Chin up Henry!" Cyrus consoles you, "look what I found!".
He is holding a massive spyglass in his hands. It consists of two black cylinders, belted by copper hoops. Lenses are gleaming dimly.
"I thought, I lost it long time ago!" he smiled, "Well, if we found it thanks to you, take it, it's yours!".
Such present improved your mood, and now you say goodbye to Cyrus going towards the exit.